{"id":"n14329-2-5","stage":2,"title":"얕다 · 浅薄","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14329-2-5-1","ko":"소개 받은 사람 어땠어?","zh":"你认识的那个人怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"소개","meaning":"介绍","explanation":"소개：介绍","readings":[{"term":"소개","audio":"/audio/7367283c48b6e4d56094.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64301","senseId":"2","lemma":"소개","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"받은","meaning":"接受，遭受，经受，承蒙","explanation":"받다：接受，遭受，经受，承蒙；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"3","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어땠어?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"7367283c48b6e4d5","term":"소개","zh":"介绍","audio":"/audio/7367283c48b6e4d56094.mp3","entryId":"64301","definition":"在互不认识的人之间建立联系，使双方相识来往。","pronunciation":["소개"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"接受，遭受，经受，承蒙","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"受到他人行为、心理作用等的影响。","pronunciation":["받따"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/62d258120a400f346158.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14329-2-5-2","ko":"시끄럽기만 하고 속은 얕은 사람 같더라.","zh":"感觉只是很吵闹，而且人很肤浅。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"시끄럽기만","meaning":"吵闹，喧嚣","explanation":"시끄럽다：吵闹，喧嚣；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"시끄럽다","audio":"/audio/72d1507eed9433fbf043.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15961","senseId":"1","lemma":"시끄럽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하고","meaning":"强调前面的状态（-기만 하다：只不过是……）","explanation":"하다：强调前面的状态（-기만 하다：只不过是……）；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62899","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"속은","meaning":"心，心眼，心地","explanation":"속：心，心眼，心地；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"속","audio":"/audio/27e1c3f6a82b5a8bcf92.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71278","senseId":"4","lemma":"속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얕은","meaning":"浅薄，肤浅","explanation":"얕다：浅薄，肤浅；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"얕다","audio":"/audio/13e9e2de072ba56aa271.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14329","senseId":"2","lemma":"얕다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같더라.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"72d1507eed9433fb","term":"시끄럽다","zh":"吵闹，喧嚣","audio":"/audio/72d1507eed9433fbf043.mp3","entryId":"15961","definition":"声音大而嘈杂，令人听起来厌烦。","pronunciation":["시끄럽따"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"强调前面的状态（-기만 하다：只不过是……）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62899","definition":"强调前面的状态（-기만 하다：只不过是……）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"27e1c3f6a82b5a8b","term":"속","zh":"心，心眼，心地","audio":"/audio/27e1c3f6a82b5a8bcf92.mp3","entryId":"71278","definition":"对待人或事物的心态或态度。","pronunciation":["속ː"]},{"id":"13e9e2de072ba56a","term":"얕다","zh":"浅薄，肤浅","audio":"/audio/13e9e2de072ba56aa271.mp3","entryId":"14329","definition":"想法或内心不慎重或不宽容。","pronunciation":["얃따"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/00f60d95b64642c40757.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.398,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14329","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":79,"sequenceScore":2.2247,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你认识的那个人怎么样？","感觉只是很吵闹，而且人很肤浅。","面包里面放了什么？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你认识的那个人怎么样？","感觉只是很吵闹，而且人很肤浅。","面包里面放了什么？"],"answer":1}]}
